== 6. The underwriter's capital under unit rows and under a common row (INS-A2, INS-A4) ==
  one underwriter, money 1 000, upkeep 5 a tick, policies of max payout 100 each, strike probability 0.05,
  loading 13 000 on the expected payout; capacity = cap_bp * available money / 10 000 less open liability;
  pays above a shield of 3 ticks of upkeep; the shortfall is a claim paid first from later income, and an
  underwriter in arrears writes nothing; removed when its money is below one tick of upkeep. 300 seeds, 300 ticks; demand for cover is at most 20 policies a tick.
